          "Hospital leadership, patients, caregivers and licensed healthcare professionals would appropriately safeguard privacy and day-to-day activities. Recognition, branding, events, photography and access would remain subject to provider rules and informed family choices. Community support must strengthen an approved need without displacing care or implying a clinical result.",
